you know, the facts on the ground,

00:37:39.580 --> 00:37:42.130
facts inside the company, they don't change. They're being changed rapidly.

00:37:42.130 --> 00:37:43.960
And so there's some things you want to get locked in.

00:37:43.960 --> 00:37:45.940
You want to get the sales execution engine going.

00:37:45.940 --> 00:37:47.620
I kept the QA engine going.

00:37:47.620 --> 00:37:51.610
[NOISE] I think for a lot of things where your- the terrain is unknown,

