Yeah, our titles a thing, um,

00:39:40.270 --> 00:39:43.900
see you ought to think about or [OVERLAPPING] of the sops to people?

00:39:43.900 --> 00:39:45.355
Like what, what are they, I mean?

00:39:45.355 --> 00:39:49.690
Yeah. I, um, I'm curious what the research doesn't ask like the,

00:39:49.690 --> 00:39:51.760
ah, I pro- I struggle with this.

