Skype or Hangout conversations that were

00:45:49.545 --> 00:45:53.220
between Mountain View and Toronto and just open all the time.

00:45:53.220 --> 00:45:55.315
So, if you're going to a coffee in the afternoon, it's pronto,

00:45:55.315 --> 00:45:58.070
you can see someone getting coffee in the kitchen [OVERLAPPING]

00:45:58.070 --> 00:45:58.950
That's really interesting [OVERLAPPING].

00:45:58.950 --> 00:46:02.020
Spontaneous interactions people who are random.

