So, you started to move things around.

00:46:10.105 --> 00:46:11.500
So, just, just on,

00:46:11.500 --> 00:46:13.480
um, on slack, ah.

00:46:13.480 --> 00:46:15.680
So [inaudible] and I, you know,

00:46:15.680 --> 00:46:17.530
project on organizational friction

00:46:17.530 --> 00:46:20.460
and at least our take at this point my technicians speak for

00:46:20.460 --> 00:46:25.545
you is that slack can be good or maybe not so good but it's a platform, It's okay.

